# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Research data and model artifacts — NOT published
#
# data/ holds Uganda Ministry of Health HMIS 033b surveillance records, DHIS2
# metadata, CHIRPS / ERA5-Land rasters, the modelling dataset and fitted model
# binaries (approximately 9 GB). These are excluded for data-governance reasons,
# because some diagnostic artifacts embed local filesystem paths, and because
# they exceed GitHub size limits. See README section "Data availability".
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/

# Large source boundary file (46 MB); the simplified web map is derived locally
UGANDA_DISTRICT.json

